<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<div class="page-head">
  <div>
    <h1 class="page-title">选课窗口配置</h1>
    <p class="page-sub">
      <% if (semester) { %>
        <span class="muted"><%= semester.name %></span>
      <% } else { %>
        <span class="muted">尚未配置学期</span>
      <% } %>
    </p>
  </div>
  <span class="badge <%= windowState.open ? 'badge-ok' : 'badge-warn' %> badge-lg"><%= windowState.label %></span>
</div>

<% if (error) { %>
  <div class="alert alert-error"><%= error %></div>
<% } %>

<section class="panel">
  <h2 class="panel-title">开放时间设置</h2>
  <p class="panel-note">
    窗口开放期间学生可选课；<strong>截止后学生无法再选课，但退课与候补补位不受影响</strong>（需求 B3 / R3）。
  </p>

  <% if (!semester) { %>
    <p class="empty">系统中还没有学期数据，请先执行 <code>npm run init-db</code>。</p>
  <% } else { %>
    <form method="post" action="/admin/semester" class="form">
      <div class="form-grid">
        <label class="field">
          <span class="field-label">选课开放时间 *</span>
          <input type="datetime-local" name="openAt" value="<%= openAtLocal %>" required>
        </label>
        <label class="field">
          <span class="field-label">选课截止时间 *</span>
          <input type="datetime-local" name="closeAt" value="<%= closeAtLocal %>" required>
        </label>
      </div>

      <div class="form-actions">
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">保存</button>
      </div>
    </form>

    <dl class="kv kv-gap">
      <dt>当前开放时间</dt><dd><%= semester.select_open_at || '未设置' %></dd>
      <dt>当前截止时间</dt><dd><%= semester.select_close_at || '未设置' %></dd>
    </dl>

    <div class="note note-info">
      想演示「截止后不能选课」：把截止时间改成一个过去的时间并保存，再回到课程查询尝试选课即可。
    </div>
  <% } %>
</section>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
